OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA dry and
OL,6,Fbright end to the day, leading to a
OL,7,Fclear night. Some isolated mist or fog
OL,8,Fpatches may form in prone spots.
OL,9,FTemperatures will drop to low single
OL,10,Ffigures in rural and sheltered spots.
OL,11,FGrass frost likely.
OL,12,
OL,13,CThursday:FHazy sunny spells through
OL,14,Fmuch of Thursday and staying dry for
OL,15,Fall. Light winds with temperatures
OL,16,Faround, or just above average for the
OL,17,Ftime of year.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
