OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FCloudy
OL,6,Fwith patchy rain on Friday before
OL,7,Fthings turn drier and brighter from
OL,8,FSaturday. Remaining settled through
OL,9,Fthe weekend with variable cloud and
OL,10,Fbright of sunny spells.
